- On a shared machine where other users may access `~/.insophinia-forage/`
- In any context where data loss would cause material harm

## 6. Backup your data

Before running the Software, **back up**:

- Any existing `~/.insophinia-forage/` directory (if you have an older version)
- Any existing MariaDB databases (the app may upgrade or downgrade MariaDB)
- Any existing `wp-config.php` files (the WordPress installer overwrites them)
- Your system PHP/nginx configs (the app does NOT touch these, but bugs could)

